    </div>

    <h4 class="font-serif font-bold text-sm text-slate-900 leading-snug">
      The 100% Public Venue Rule: Verified Date Experiences
    </h4>

    <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600 mt-1.5 leading-relaxed font-sans">
      Meeting foreign matches in Dubai, UAE, or travel hubs? Never agree to isolated private residences. Anchor initial dates in certified public attractions, city tours, and neutral venues.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-3 pt-2.5 border-t border-slate-100">
      <a
        href="/go?offer=admitad_18183&source=sidebar_ad&trigger=public_venues&intent=travel_dating&sub1=sidebar_ad&sub2=travel_dating&sub3=venue_box"
        rel="nofollow sponsored"
        target="_blank"
        class="sidebar-partner-link min-h-[40px] w-full flex items-center justify-center text-center px-3 py-2 bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-white font-mono font-bold text-[11px] uppercase transition-colors shadow-[2px_2px_0px_0px_#0f172a] hover:shadow-none"
      >
        BROWSE VERIFIED PUBLIC VENUES ↗
      </a>
      <span class="block text-center text-[9px] font-mono text-slate-500 mt-1.5">
        RaynaTours Global · Instant Mobile Voucher Clearance
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- WIDGET 6: Field Investigation Protocol Standards -->
  <div class="bg-white border border-slate-300 rounded-none sm:rounded-sm overflow-hidden">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-3 border-b border-slate-200 bg-[#FAF7F2]">
      <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-rose-700 shrink-0"></span>
      <span class="font-mono text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900">
        Field Protocol // Standards
